<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A constraint that operates primarily at the level of the signified. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:inScheme and skos:related."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Semantic constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Costrizione semantica"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Costrizione che interviene prioritariamente sul significato. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:inScheme e skos:related."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
